sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as SQL Client
    participant GW as Gateway / Router
    participant QOPT as Query Optimizer
    participant COORD as Coordinator Node
    participant W1 as Worker Node 1
    participant W2 as Worker Node 2
    participant W3 as Worker Node 3
    participant STORE as Cloud Storage

    Client->>GW: Submit SQL query
    GW->>QOPT: Parse & validate SQL

    Note over QOPT: Parse SQL into AST<br/>Resolve table/column refs<br/>Check permissions

    QOPT->>QOPT: Generate logical plan
    QOPT->>QOPT: Cost-based optimization
    Note over QOPT: Partition pruning<br/>Join reordering<br/>Predicate pushdown

    QOPT->>COORD: Distribute execution plan

    par Parallel Execution
        COORD->>W1: Fragment 1 (partitions 1-100)
        COORD->>W2: Fragment 2 (partitions 101-200)
        COORD->>W3: Fragment 3 (partitions 201-300)
    end

    par Data Fetch
        W1->>STORE: Read required columns
        W2->>STORE: Read required columns
        W3->>STORE: Read required columns
    end

    STORE-->>W1: Compressed column chunks
    STORE-->>W2: Compressed column chunks
    STORE-->>W3: Compressed column chunks

    Note over W1,W3: Local filter, aggregate,<br/>partial sort

    W1-->>COORD: Partial results
    W2-->>COORD: Partial results
    W3-->>COORD: Partial results

    Note over COORD: Merge, final aggregate,<br/>sort, limit

    COORD-->>GW: Final result set
    GW-->>Client: Return results
